# rclipboard deploy inventory
#
# Format (whitespace-delimited):
#   hostname    init_system    endpoint_type    [extra_ssh_opts...]
#
# hostname       — SSH target: bare hostname (uses ~/.ssh/config), user@host, or IP
# init_system    — "systemd" or "none"
# endpoint_type  — "uds" (Unix socket) or "tcp" (127.0.0.1:8989)
# extra_ssh_opts — optional, passed verbatim to ssh/scp (e.g. -p 2222, -i ~/.ssh/key)
#
# Config template used:
#   deploy/config/<hostname>.toml  (host-specific override, if it exists)
#   deploy/config/config.<endpoint_type>.toml  (otherwise)
#
# Examples:
# workstation   systemd   uds
# devbox        none      tcp   -p 2222
# raspi         none      uds   -i ~/.ssh/raspi_key
# pi@192.168.1.5  none    uds   -p 22 -i ~/.ssh/pi_key
